<title>POLAND: POLIFARB-W APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</title>
<headline>POLIFARB-W APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 1.8 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.76 vs   1.59</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.90 vs   2.70</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.85 vs   2.29</p>
<p> Sales		   20.45 vs  17.49</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.73 vs   4.95</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 9.19 vs   8.17</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.87 vs   7.29</p>
<p> Sales		   66.46 vs  55.67</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish paint maker is Polifarb Wroclaw</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
